       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.      CLASTNUM.
       AUTHOR.          CA YODER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.    OCTOBER 2003.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D  C L A S T N U M                                          *
      *                                                            *
      *D    THIS PROGRAM FINDS THE LAST ITEM NUMBER ON A PO.       *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *C
      *C  CHANGES:
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.


       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT DPOITEM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DPOITEM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOITEM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS1002.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  ITEM-NUMBER                   PIC 9(4)   VALUE 0.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X      VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X      VALUE "0".

      **************************************************************
      **                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
      **************************************************************

       COPY DPOITEM     IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  PASSED-PARAMETERS.
           05  PASS-PO-NUMBER        PIC X(14).
           05  PASS-ITEM-NUMBER      PIC X(4).

      **************************************************************
      **           P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N            **
      **************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION   USING PASSED-PARAMETERS.

       0-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN.

           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

           GOBACK.

      **************************************************************
       1-HSK.
      **************************************************************
           OPEN INPUT DPOITEM-I.

      **************************************************************
       2-EOJ.
      **************************************************************
           CLOSE  DPOITEM-I.

      **************************************************************
       6-MAIN.
      **************************************************************
           MOVE SPACES            TO  PASS-ITEM-NUMBER.
           MOVE PASS-PO-NUMBER    TO  PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I.
           MOVE SPACES            TO  ITEMNO  OF DPOITEM-REC-I.
           MOVE 0                 TO  ITEM-NUMBER.
           PERFORM UNTIL ITEM-NUMBER = 999 OR
                         FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               ADD 1 TO ITEM-NUMBER
               MOVE ITEM-NUMBER   TO  ITEMNO  OF DPOITEM-REC-I
               READ DPOITEM-I INTO BUF-DPOITEM
                   AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
           MOVE ITEM-NUMBER       TO  PASS-ITEM-NUMBER.

